{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46215","headline":"上卢使君二首 二 · 贯休","name":"上卢使君二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"司马迁文亚圣人，三头九陌碾香尘。\n尽传棣萼麟兼凤，终作昌朝甫与申。\n楼耸娇歌疎雨过，风含和气满城春。\n因知寰海昇平去，又见高宗梦里人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46215.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46215","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}